# IoT IDS/IPS

A modular IoT Intrusion Detection and Prevention System.

## Current stage

Phase 1 establishes the development environment and project structure.
Traffic capture, ML detection, and firewall enforcement are not implemented yet.

## Planned features

- Dataset validation and preprocessing
- XGBoost training and evaluation
- PCAP processing and feature extraction
- Attack detection and prediction logging
- Controlled IPS response
- Flask monitoring dashboard
- Future cyber-range and adaptive RL defender integration

## Safety

Initially, the project uses offline datasets and authorized PCAP files.
Firewall enforcement will remain disabled until it is implemented and tested
in an isolated lab.
